From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:28:28 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 012/207] deepseek: reserve full requests and agree on pool
 growth

Address tanchunsiong's issue #55 with ratulsarna's long-context concurrency corroboration. Reprice damaged cache hits, reserve complete prompt and reply ownership before work, and roll back recoverable growth uniformly across ranks before device-table mutation. Host tests cover asymmetric pressure, quota rollback and subsequent admission; reported GPU concurrency remains unqualified.
